   "text": "Owen's friend asked how many hikes he did this year.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.056
  },
  {
   "text": "He guessed twelve. His photos showed thirty, and he couldn't name half the trails.",
   "start": 3.206,
   "end": 7.54
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: write each hike down the same day, date, trail, miles and who came.",
   "start": 7.84,
   "end": 12.336
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for next year.",
